10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=774xcmHFDKoQ7kNvwFI8Z0s&_nc_oc=Adq0aiOAlq7f8Cqkii5e7-lbX76ghQtKdimE83BgTWhvOD7a2u0OVTtAP51Mru50ft0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af768QTLgl3Lym1euXo4svmqya0DW07w_i6ZNMtRUfT5rg&oe=6A15AD4C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CkTPGOoCIDIQ7kNvwEM4prf&_nc_oc=AdpsPngmfk1iPQMVvKQtcQwGRTQJIRcrj1vYKA1E0SPHIYgrOjS4xQbQ8bYCBUrdNAg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7zdJahyzDFiWngDT3hDBY5ZYd-TOltDHn45jE8mjcvQw&oe=6A15BE3C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lTLdjw8DMpUQ7kNvwHjtlFz&_nc_oc=Adp9AXOlLRCumoQEzNp6xA5nActUtW5LGlW1j2kRvG8YJxEml0vfgoWEfQ0Vo-ovNfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af44ATsa7DLmkoiGVh7P2mDlehgMqwW4V897n9C-KwoYdA&oe=6A159D2B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore